    "description": "Stream Joy + Earn Rewards + Share Love\r\nHallmark+ is everything you love about Hallmark, all in one place. Start your FREE trial!\r\nHallmark+ is an all-new streaming service and membership program that gives\r\nyou unlimited access to exclusive new original series, reality shows, movies, and other\r\nfeel-good content featuring beloved Hallmark stars. You\u2019ll also enjoy a huge selection of\r\nHallmark rom-coms, cozy mysteries, heartfelt dramas, and all your favorite holiday\r\nmovies!\r\nPlus, get benefits that make it easier and more rewarding to care and connect, with free\r\ngreeting cards every month, unlimited free eCards, exclusive discounts and rewards,\r\nsurprise gifts, and more.\r\nIt\u2019s easy to start streaming with two subscription options:\r\n\u2022 Annual (Two months FREE!)\r\n\u2022 Monthly\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions are automatically renewed until cancelled.\r\nHallmark+ is owned and operated by Hallmark Media United States, LLC, a wholly-owned\r\nsubsidiary of Hallmark Cards, Incorporated. For more information, please read our Privacy\r\nPolicy and Terms of Service.\r\nhttps://www.hallmark.com/privacy/\r\nhttps://www.hallmark.com/terms-of-use/",
